Description: VanillaGreen desktop shell for Hyprland and Niri
 VGS provides a bar, launcher, settings, lock screen, notifications, capture,
 wallpapers, and application theme generation.
 .
 Optional features stay inert until their tool is installed; run
 "vshell deps status" to see which feature groups are unsatisfied.

Package: vgs-shell-assets
Architecture: all
Depends: vgs-shell (>= ${source:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Optional VGS themes, wallpapers, and bundled icon themes
 The vgs-shell package ships the coppernight default theme only. This package
 adds every other bundled theme, its wallpapers, and the vendored icon themes.
